<title>UK: INSTANT VIEW - UK unemployment, earnings PSBR.</title>
<headline>INSTANT VIEW - UK unemployment, earnings PSBR.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is a list of analysts' reactions to UK March PSBR, February average earnings and March unemployment data published at 0830 GMT.</p>
<p>COOPERATIVE BANK ECONOMIST ANDREW SNOWBALL - &quot;On balance a broadly positive set of numbers. Most of the figures are in line with expectations or in the case of the PSBR, slightly below.&quot;</p>
</text>
